# 🚀 Quick Start Guide

Get the speech agent running in 5 minutes!

## Installation (3 steps)

### Step 1: Install Dependencies

```bash
# Ubuntu/Debian
sudo apt-get install python3-pyaudio python3-all-dev portaudio19-dev

# macOS
brew install portaudio

# Windows - Skip this step (pre-built)
```

### Step 2: Install Python Packages

```bash
pip install -r requirements.txt
```

### Step 3: Configure Environment

```bash
# Copy the environment file
cp .env .env.bak

# Edit .env with your settings (optional, defaults work fine)
nano .env  # or use your editor
```

## Run the Agent

### Option 1: Google Speech-to-Text (Free, Good Quality)

```bash
python speech_agent.py
```

### Option 2: OpenAI Whisper (Better Accuracy, Costs Money)

1. Get API key from https://platform.openai.com/api-keys

2. Add to `.env`:
```env
OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-your-key-here
```

3. Run:
```bash
python speech_agent_whisper.py
```

